B.aeH=new A.hJ("Unpaid guests","When a guest leaves and the guesthouse portal shows money still owed, the guest is told at once to pay within 30 days. NamStay reminds them on day 7, 20 and 28 (you can also call, WhatsApp or SMS them here). After 30 days they go on the unpaid list: every guesthouse is warned when that phone number books. When the guesthouse records the payment, the guest comes off the list automatically.",null)
B.aeJ=new A.hJ("NamStay bank account",'The account where owners pay NamStay. Only the super admin and admins with the "NamStay bank details" right can change it. Every admin is told of a change, and owners see it only after 24 hours. If a change looks wrong, any admin can revoke it in those 24 hours.',null)
B.aeK=new A.hJ("Guest feedback","What guests said after their stay. Only you see it, not other guests.",null)
