B.aeP=new A.hJ("Special arrangement",'Write what the guest must know when they arrive. For example: "Key is in box 3 at the gate" or "Security will open for you". The guest sees it in the app, and reception or security see it when the guest arrives.',null)
B.aeQ=new A.hJ("Team management","Team: who is working now and what they are doing. Tasks: give work and follow it (to do, doing, done). Leave: days off and holidays. Front desk: how your team uses the app. The buttons at the top open Reports and History.",null)
B.aeV=new A.hJ("Commission guesthouses","Guesthouses that pay NamStay a commission for each booking made in the app, instead of a monthly fee. They are never blocked automatically: only by hand in NamStay Billing when an invoice is not paid. Each guesthouse can have its own rate; if not, the general rate is used.",null)
B.aeW=new A.hJ("Bypass check","A walk-in is flagged when its phone number belongs to a NamStay guest who, in the 30 days before, looked at that guesthouse, chatted with it, or made an app booking that was not paid. It may be a guest who came through NamStay but was recorded as a walk-in. Check it (call the owner or the guest), then you can add the commission. The owner is told and can answer in the help desk.",null)
